message.content:
Design an implementation plan for adding a hover interaction to the GNB (global navigation) links inside `.no-drawer__reveal-inner` in the NINEONELABS project.

## Goal
When a user hovers over a `.no-drawer__gnb-link`, a `.no-loop-filter-rect` rect indicator should pop in on the LEFT of the link text, with the text shifting right by the rect's measured width (via `getBoundingClientRect`). The active state (`is-active`) should show the rect immediately (no animation).

## Current state

### HTML structure (`views/components/drawer.php` lines 70-116):
Two variants of gnb-link:

**With sub:**
```html
<li class="no-drawer__gnb-item no-drawer__gnb-item--has-sub">
    <div class="no-drawer__reveal"><div class="no-drawer__reveal-inner">
        <div class="no-drawer__gnb-row">
            <a href="..." class="no-drawer__gnb-link wavy-link f-display-0 [is-active]">
                <span class="no-drawer__gnb-label">LABEL</span>
            </a>
            <ul class="no-drawer__gnb-sub">...</ul>
        </div>
    </div></div>
</li>
```

**Without sub (+ works badge):**
```html
<li class="no-drawer__gnb-item">
    <div class="no-drawer__reveal"><div class="no-drawer__reveal-inner">
        <a href="..." class="no-drawer__gnb-link wavy-link f-display-0 [is-active]">
            <span class="no-drawer__gnb-label">LABEL</span>
        </a>
        <!-- optional works badge here -->
    </div></div>
</li>
```

### SCSS (`resource/scss/layouts/_drawer.scss` lines 258-282):
```scss
&__gnb-link {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: var(--gutter-sm) 0;
  gap: var(--gutter-sm);
  color: var(--clr-text-desc);
  font-family: var(--family-en-title);
  transition: color var(--transition-fast), text-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  &:hover {
    color: var(--clr-text-title);
    text-shadow: 0 0 fluid(20, 40) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  }
  &.is-active {
    color: var(--clr-text-title);
    text-shadow: none;
  }
}
```

### Existing `.no-loop-filter-rect` component (`resource/scss/components/_loop-filter-rect.scss`):
```scss
.no-loop-filter-rect {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  span {
    width: fluid(3, 5); // ~3-5px
    height: fluid(3, 5);
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.16;
    animation: no-loop-filter-rect-pulse 1.2s linear infinite;
  }
  // staggered delays: 0s, 0.18s, 0.54s, 0.36s
}
```
Total rect size: approximately 6-10px × 6-10px (2×2 grid of tiny squares).

### TypeScript (`resource/ts/ui/Drawer.ts` lines 93-121):
```typescript
protected mount(): void {
  if (this.isDisposed) return;
  const root = this.getElement();
  if (!root) return;
  this._mountTrigger(root);
  document.addEventListener("keydown", this._boundKeydown);
  this._mountMagneticCorner(root);
}
```
GSAP is accessed via `getGsap()` → `(window as WindowWithGsap).gsap`.

`DRAWER_CLASSES.linkActive` = `"is-active"`
`DOM_CONFIG.drawer.gnbLinkSelector` = `".no-drawer__gnb-link[href]"`

All TS types go into `resource/ts/types/*.types.ts`.

## Requirements

1. **HTML**: Add `<span class="no-loop-filter-rect no-drawer__gnb-rect" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>` BEFORE `<span class="no-drawer__gnb-label">` in both gnb-link variants.

2. **SCSS**: Style `__gnb-rect` as absolutely positioned within the link, hidden by default, NOT using CSS transforms (GSAP will own all transforms including vertical centering via `yPercent`).

3. **TS**: In `Drawer.ts`, add `_initGnbRects(root)` called from `mount()`:
   - For each gnb-link:
     - `gsap.set(rectEl, { opacity: 0, scale: 0.5, transformOrigin: 'left center', yPercent: -50 })` on init
     - If `is-active`: immediately show rect at full opacity/scale and shift label
     - `mouseenter`: `getBoundingClientRect()` → measure rect width → GSAP animate rect in (opacity→1, scale→1) + label translateX by (width + gap) using `power3.out`
     - `mouseleave`: if NOT active, GSAP animate rect out (opacity→0, scale→0.5) + label translateX back to 0 using `power2.in`
   - Store cleanup fns for proper disposal

4. **Disposal**: Add `private _gnbRectCleanups: Array<() => void> = []` and override dispose to call them.

## Design questions to resolve in the plan:
- What gap value to use between rect and label? (CSS `--gutter-sm` is the flex gap; for JS translateX calc, we should read the same gap from computed styles OR use a constant)
- Should label translateX be animated separately from the rect, or should they use the same duration/ease?
- How to handle resize (rect width cached or re-measured each hover)?

Please provide a detailed step-by-step implementation plan covering all three files, with exact code for SCSS additions, TS method, and PHP HTML changes. Include specific line numbers where changes go in each file.

